==Battleground==
*5 [[Fireworks Guys (High-Yield)]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*3 [[Fireworks Guys (Low-Yield)]] spawn after 8.33 seconds<sup>250f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Fireworks Guys (High-Yield)]] spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Fireworks Guys (Low-Yield)]] spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Doge]] spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Fireworks Guys (High-Yield)]] spawn, delay 3.33~5 seconds<sup>100f~150f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**20 [[Fireworks Guys (Low-Yield)]] spawn, delay 2.67~4 seconds<sup>80f~120f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 80% HP:
**20 [[Fireworks Guys (High-Yield)]] spawn, delay 2.67~4 seconds<sup>80f~120f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 70% HP:
**10 [[Fireworks Guys (Low-Yield)]] spawn, delay 2~3 seconds<sup>60f~90f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 60% HP:
**10 [[Fireworks Guys (High-Yield)]] spawn, delay 2~3 seconds<sup>60f~90f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

